1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,450
Your college essay can sound impressive.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,350
And still say absolutely nothing.

3
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:05,850
Take this line.

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:09,000
Passionate. Perseverance. Personal growth.

5
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:12,450
But what did we actually learn about this student?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,850
Now watch.

7
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:17,650
They tutored a neighbor in algebra — and got it by explaining it.

8
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:22,300
Now we know what they did, who they helped, what they figured out.

9
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,250
Specific beats impressive.

10
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,400
That's why AppGap helps you look past the big words,

11
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,800
and see what your essay is actually saying.

12
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,600
Make every word mean something.
